            <ArticleTitle>Pentazocine induced widespread cutaneous and myo-fibrosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>368-70</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of extensive subcutaneous and muscle fibrosis in a 26-year-old Indian woman caused by repeated intramuscular pentazocine injections over five years to highlight the extent and sequelae of this avoidable condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
